(4809184, 696159, 34192, '<td valign="top">works for challenge but kind of boring 7</td>', 'works for challenge but kind of boring 7', '2008-07-07 13:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809241, 695441, 84520, '<td valign="top">I have this one pegged for the blue, since it''s pretty sweet, and it strictly fits the definition of the challenge.  Personally, I''d much rather be looking at the beautiful textures of the metal end and paper tube...</td>', 'I have this one pegged for the blue, since it''s pretty sweet, and it strictly fits the definition of the challenge.  Personally, I''d much rather be looking at the beautiful textures of the metal end and paper tube...', '2008-07-07 14:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809244, 695955, 84520, '<td valign="top">Good use of a yellow border--it keeps the negative space at the top from being unbalanced.</td>', 'Good use of a yellow border--it keeps the negative space at the top from being unbalanced.', '2008-07-07 14:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809246, 695359, 84520, '<td valign="top">Yeah, there have been alot of fireworks in this challenge, but I still like these images.    The capture is flawless, and the reflection looks great.</td>', 'Yeah, there have been alot of fireworks in this challenge, but I still like these images.    The capture is flawless, and the reflection looks great.', '2008-07-07 14:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809248, 695859, 84520, '<td valign="top">Too much negative space.  It''s a nice capture, but when over 3/4ths of the image contains nothing, then you''ve gone too far.</td>', 'Too much negative space.  It''s a nice capture, but when over 3/4ths of the image contains nothing, then you''ve gone too far.', '2008-07-07 14:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809250, 696155, 84520, '<td valign="top">I like this.  The horizon is almost impossible to distinguish, which makes for a pleasant gradiant of smooth grey tones.  Simple, elegant, and effective--well done!</td>', 'I like this.  The horizon is almost impossible to distinguish, which makes for a pleasant gradiant of smooth grey tones.  Simple, elegant, and effective--well done!', '2008-07-07 14:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809251, 696074, 84520, '<td valign="top">The lighting is too harsh on the bush.  Come back in the evening for softer and more vibrant light</td>', 'The lighting is too harsh on the bush.  Come back in the evening for softer and more vibrant light', '2008-07-07 14:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809252, 696167, 84520, '<td valign="top">Alot of grain--run this bad boy through neatimage once or twice, and you''ll be set.</td>', 'Alot of grain--run this bad boy through neatimage once or twice, and you''ll be set.', '2008-07-07 14:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809258, 695643, 84520, '<td valign="top">The white squares don''t look white, they''re a wierd reddish blue--it''s not a huge deal, but it would be nice to see it fixed in PS with a simple whitebalance adjustment.  My other criticism is that there''s a partial and distracting reflection of the marble in the lower right.  Since it''s advanced editing, you should clone that sort of thing out.</td>', 'The white squares don''t look white, they''re a wierd reddish blue--it''s not a huge deal, but it would be nice to see it fixed in PS with a simple whitebalance adjustment.  My other criticism is that there''s a partial and distracting reflection of the marble in the lower right.  Since it''s advanced editing, you should clone that sort of thing out.', '2008-07-07 14:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809259, 695323, 84520, '<td valign="top">The composition could use some work, but it''s a ''point of color'', and I give you props for capturing a welding torch.  f/32 and 1/2000 would do the trick :)</td>', 'The composition could use some work, but it''s a ''point of color'', and I give you props for capturing a welding torch.  f/32 and 1/2000 would do the trick :)', '2008-07-07 14:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809260, 695717, 84520, '<td valign="top">This would benefit from a pass through a USM adjustment--the flower and some of the foreground leaves aren''t very sharp</td>', 'This would benefit from a pass through a USM adjustment--the flower and some of the foreground leaves aren''t very sharp', '2008-07-07 14:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809261, 695114, 84520, '<td valign="top">The light is pretty harsh--if you can''t shoot in the evening or morning, a polarizing filter and a warmer whitebalance go a long way to softening the light and bringing out color in your subject.</td>', 'The light is pretty harsh--if you can''t shoot in the evening or morning, a polarizing filter and a warmer whitebalance go a long way to softening the light and bringing out color in your subject.', '2008-07-07 14:25:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809262, 696071, 84520, '<td valign="top">Simple, clean, and surprisingly beautiful.</td>', 'Simple, clean, and surprisingly beautiful.', '2008-07-07 14:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809263, 696122, 84520, '<td valign="top">Very blue!  Nice DoF and color saturation.</td>', 'Very blue!  Nice DoF and color saturation.', '2008-07-07 14:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809265, 695724, 84520, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture with the reflection.  The fireworks could be a little sharper, but overall, the scene is effective and pretty.</td>', 'Beautiful capture with the reflection.  The fireworks could be a little sharper, but overall, the scene is effective and pretty.', '2008-07-07 14:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809267, 695671, 84520, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Very simple, sublime way to meet this challenge.  My once criticism is the lens flare in the lower left of the image and extending to just below the sun.  Either clone that out or try your luck with the flare correction tool in PS.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Very simple, sublime way to meet this challenge.  My once criticism is the lens flare in the lower left of the image and extending to just below the sun.  Either clone that out or try your luck with the flare correction tool in PS.', '2008-07-07 14:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809269, 695948, 84520, '<td valign="top">His mischevieous eye is out of focus.</td>', 'His mischevieous eye is out of focus.', '2008-07-07 14:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809270, 693500, 84520, '<td valign="top">Nice DoF.  I would have cropped a little more of the right side of the image.</td>', 'Nice DoF.  I would have cropped a little more of the right side of the image.', '2008-07-07 14:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809271, 695482, 84520, '<td valign="top">You can stand under my umberella...</td>', 'You can stand under my umberella...', '2008-07-07 14:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809272, 695120, 84520, '<td valign="top">Ooh, he''s a beautiful butterfly, but he''s also slightly out of focus.  Extend the DoF to include all of him.</td>', 'Ooh, he''s a beautiful butterfly, but he''s also slightly out of focus.  Extend the DoF to include all of him.', '2008-07-07 14:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809273, 695910, 84520, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice image, but with the red background for red/white flowers, you''re just BEGGING the DNMC police to give you 3''s.</td>', 'It''s a nice image, but with the red background for red/white flowers, you''re just BEGGING the DNMC police to give you 3''s.', '2008-07-07 14:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809276, 696094, 84520, '<td valign="top">With some direct lighting on the flower, you''ll improve the color, texture, and sharpness of your subject.  Currently, it just doesn''t stand out enough.</td>', 'With some direct lighting on the flower, you''ll improve the color, texture, and sharpness of your subject.  Currently, it just doesn''t stand out enough.', '2008-07-07 14:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809282, 695225, 95154, '<td valign="top">The contrast between the stark auburn/orange and the blue is nice , especially with the slight green rim of the rind.</td>', 'The contrast between the stark auburn/orange and the blue is nice , especially with the slight green rim of the rind.', '2008-07-07 14:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809460, 695841, 12661, '<td valign="top">The title is a tad odd for this image. The focal point (and the point of color) is the brakes. For this title, I would be expecting to look at a NOx tank (or something similar). But this is a photography contest, not a titling contest. So photo wise, the composition is good and the focus is spot on. I do feel that the lighting is off. I would have preferred to see the brake calipers brighter instead of hiding in the shadows.</td>', 'The title is a tad odd for this image. The focal point (and the point of color) is the brakes. For this title, I would be expecting to look at a NOx tank (or something similar). But this is a photography contest, not a titling contest. So photo wise, the composition is good and the focus is spot on. I do feel that the lighting is off. I would have preferred to see the brake calipers brighter instead of hiding in the shadows.', '2008-07-07 16:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809495, 696155, 57229, '<td valign="top">Is that no fishing or no nets? Works, anyway :)</td>', 'Is that no fishing or no nets? Works, anyway :)', '2008-07-07 16:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809506, 696098, 55956, '<td valign="top">great! 10</td>', 'great! 10', '2008-07-07 16:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809508, 694916, 55956, '<td valign="top">great composition</td>', 'great composition', '2008-07-07 16:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809513, 695849, 55956, '<td valign="top">good good good!</td>', 'good good good!', '2008-07-07 16:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809604, 696080, 28882, '<td valign="top">can''t DNMC this!</td>', 'can''t DNMC this!', '2008-07-07 17:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809605, 694915, 28882, '<td valign="top">nice detail and comp.</td>', 'nice detail and comp.', '2008-07-07 17:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809650, 696143, 64670, '<td valign="top">The light is really flat.</td>', 'The light is really flat.', '2008-07-07 17:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809656, 696060, 92296, '<td valign="top">The shade from the hat over the eyes is ace and the pattern on the hat complements the overall composition.  Not sure her left shoulder adds much, but adding to my favourites and giving it 9 all the same.</td>', 'The shade from the hat over the eyes is ace and the pattern on the hat complements the overall composition.  Not sure her left shoulder adds much, but adding to my favourites and giving it 9 all the same.', '2008-07-07 17:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4809664, 695641, 64670, '<td valign="top">Could never DNMC this image - GRIN!<br/> <br/>You''re very funny - hope it gets the reaction you wish for.</td>', 'Could never DNMC this image - GRIN! You''re very funny - hope it gets the reaction you wish for.', '2008-07-07 17:50:04.000000', NULL, 1);
