(4814685, 696144, 90658, '<td valign="top">I am going to be extremely literal with this challenge description...not something that I usually do, however.<br/> <br/>The idea, in my intrepretation, was to make the point of color the subject of the photo...thus the shirt would be the subject, and that makes no sense in the context of the photo.  So that leaves me with the unfortunate conclusion of DNMC.<br/> <br/>This is a nice environmental portrait, though.</td>', 'I am going to be extremely literal with this challenge description...not something that I usually do, however. The idea, in my intrepretation, was to make the point of color the subject of the photo...thus the shirt would be the subject, and that makes no sense in the context of the photo.  So that leaves me with the unfortunate conclusion of DNMC. This is a nice environmental portrait, though.', '2008-07-09 12:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4814687, 696143, 90658, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you went on the limb and used white as a color.</td>', 'I''m glad you went on the limb and used white as a color.', '2008-07-09 12:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4814696, 696145, 90658, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I actually really enjoy this shot.  Some might feel that there is too much other color going on behind the hydrant, but not me.<br/> <br/>This is a shot where most people might choose to crop out the hydrant, or get an angle where it''s not even there.  Because it so obviously sticks out, plus the color is bright, I just love it.</td>', 'Nice!  I actually really enjoy this shot.  Some might feel that there is too much other color going on behind the hydrant, but not me. This is a shot where most people might choose to crop out the hydrant, or get an angle where it''s not even there.  Because it so obviously sticks out, plus the color is bright, I just love it.', '2008-07-09 13:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
