(4814769, 694940, 90658, '<td valign="top">Great, wonderful and interesting to look at.  The point of color...red...doesn''t seem to be the MAIN subject, but it is part of the subject, so I will give credit.</td>', 'Great, wonderful and interesting to look at.  The point of color...red...doesn''t seem to be the MAIN subject, but it is part of the subject, so I will give credit.', '2008-07-09 13:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
