(4815981, 695475, 84520, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but your lighting needs some work.   The flowers are indeed a ''point of color'' but the light doesn''t make them pop out with vibrant color and texture.  Try sunrise/sunset light, and if that fails, a warmer whitebalance will make this light a little less dull.</td>', 'I like the composition, but your lighting needs some work.   The flowers are indeed a ''point of color'' but the light doesn''t make them pop out with vibrant color and texture.  Try sunrise/sunset light, and if that fails, a warmer whitebalance will make this light a little less dull.', '2008-07-09 22:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4815984, 695849, 84520, '<td valign="top">I like the use of the black squares...there''s alot of depth and a strong sense of space in this image, which is pretty rare around here.</td>', 'I like the use of the black squares...there''s alot of depth and a strong sense of space in this image, which is pretty rare around here.', '2008-07-09 22:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4815986, 695997, 84520, '<td valign="top">The flowers don''t seem very sharp...try an unsharpen mask (despite the name, it makes an image sharper) in PS.  The algorithm will bring out the tone and definition of your subject.</td>', 'The flowers don''t seem very sharp...try an unsharpen mask (despite the name, it makes an image sharper) in PS.  The algorithm will bring out the tone and definition of your subject.', '2008-07-09 22:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
