(4817010, 695323, 63269, '<td valign="top">IMHO, this is a rather confusing image on the whole. If it weren''t for the title I wouldn''t have a clue what this was. I think that perhaps a different lighting technique or a different, less cluttered composition might help out. Granted, I would imagine this is probably a difficult subject to photograph!</td>', 'IMHO, this is a rather confusing image on the whole. If it weren''t for the title I wouldn''t have a clue what this was. I think that perhaps a different lighting technique or a different, less cluttered composition might help out. Granted, I would imagine this is probably a difficult subject to photograph!', '2008-07-10 12:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4817011, 693964, 63269, '<td valign="top">Well done, I like the contrasts.</td>', 'Well done, I like the contrasts.', '2008-07-10 12:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4817013, 695724, 63269, '<td valign="top">Bravo, this is a beautiful, well composed capture. I like how the trees off to the side are sort of lit up by the lights below. 6</td>', 'Bravo, this is a beautiful, well composed capture. I like how the trees off to the side are sort of lit up by the lights below. 6', '2008-07-10 12:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4817016, 695831, 63269, '<td valign="top">very interesting! My only complaint is that the composition isn''t very strong and everything is a little cluttered. My eyes aren''t really sure where to rest and sort of wander around the photo. I have no idea how one would fix that though - intersections of course always cluttered with telephone poles, signs, and wires strung helterskelter. composing a good composition, I imagine, would be quite difficult. Otherwise this is an interesting concept. :)</td>', 'very interesting! My only complaint is that the composition isn''t very strong and everything is a little cluttered. My eyes aren''t really sure where to rest and sort of wander around the photo. I have no idea how one would fix that though - intersections of course always cluttered with telephone poles, signs, and wires strung helterskelter. composing a good composition, I imagine, would be quite difficult. Otherwise this is an interesting concept. :)', '2008-07-10 12:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4817023, 696037, 63269, '<td valign="top">Although I''m not entirely sure how strongly this meets the challenge, I love the post-processing and the lighting. It is a superb photo.</td>', 'Although I''m not entirely sure how strongly this meets the challenge, I love the post-processing and the lighting. It is a superb photo.', '2008-07-10 12:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4817031, 695983, 63269, '<td valign="top">This looks like it cold use a touch more contrast. On my screen, there aren''t any white highlights anywhere; things that should be white are gray instead. Perhaps, however, you did this on purpose to create mood. The overall grayness does give the image a very gloomy atmosphere. Also, it''s difficult to tell, but to my eyes the focus seems a little fuzzy. However, the composition is marvelous! :)</td>', 'This looks like it cold use a touch more contrast. On my screen, there aren''t any white highlights anywhere; things that should be white are gray instead. Perhaps, however, you did this on purpose to create mood. The overall grayness does give the image a very gloomy atmosphere. Also, it''s difficult to tell, but to my eyes the focus seems a little fuzzy. However, the composition is marvelous! :)', '2008-07-10 12:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4817041, 693645, 63269, '<td valign="top">I absolutely <i>love</i> the colors you''ve captured in the water. Gorgeous! :) Personally, I think the composition could be stronger... Having the subject centered doesn''t work very well in this particular case. Just my opinion. :)</td>', 'I absolutely love the colors you''ve captured in the water. Gorgeous! :) Personally, I think the composition could be stronger... Having the subject centered doesn''t work very well in this particular case. Just my opinion. :)', '2008-07-10 12:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4817072, 695955, 63269, '<td valign="top">Cheerfully beautiful! Just as a thought, I personally might have adjusted the color a bit to make the yellow a little more orange/gold. But that''s totally personal, this is beautiful just as it is. ;)</td>', 'Cheerfully beautiful! Just as a thought, I personally might have adjusted the color a bit to make the yellow a little more orange/gold. But that''s totally personal, this is beautiful just as it is. ;)', '2008-07-10 12:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4817080, 695225, 63269, '<td valign="top">Such bright, luch colors and neat textures. This is very well done!</td>', 'Such bright, luch colors and neat textures. This is very well done!', '2008-07-10 12:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4817640, 695955, 88718, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Elegant flower and powerful colour combination</td>', 'Nice composition. Elegant flower and powerful colour combination', '2008-07-10 17:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4817767, 695106, 88640, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture. I feel that a bit of PS could really make the colors pop and the subject stand out more. with a bit more saturation and sharpness, this could have scored higher (IMO).</td>', 'Amazing capture. I feel that a bit of PS could really make the colors pop and the subject stand out more. with a bit more saturation and sharpness, this could have scored higher (IMO).', '2008-07-10 18:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4817851, 695533, 40484, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, love the perspective. I think it might have been more effective for point of colour if her lips had not been blue as well.</td>', 'Cute shot, love the perspective. I think it might have been more effective for point of colour if her lips had not been blue as well.', '2008-07-10 19:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4817865, 696122, 95697, '<td valign="top">It''s good, but the purple is distracting. Maybe a tigther crop would have worked better?</td>', 'It''s good, but the purple is distracting. Maybe a tigther crop would have worked better?', '2008-07-10 19:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4817868, 695474, 95697, '<td valign="top">Pretty pretty portrait, but it doesn''t fit the theme too well. I still like it though, but that''s because it''s such a technically great and absolutely adorable photo.</td>', 'Pretty pretty portrait, but it doesn''t fit the theme too well. I still like it though, but that''s because it''s such a technically great and absolutely adorable photo.', '2008-07-10 19:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4817869, 696159, 95697, '<td valign="top">Very creative ^^</td>', 'Very creative ^^', '2008-07-10 19:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4817883, 695745, 95697, '<td valign="top">*lol* Then you haven''t seen the horrible sculpture that they put outside our train station! It''s a puke brown statement to homoerotic writers with dislocated joints and little corn and human figures dancing on it...<br/> <br/>It ain''t pretty.<br/> <br/> <br/>But besides that, I like the repeated curves of the building in the photo - it makes the entire image spin. It''s difficult to decide which colour that''s most dominant though - the blue or red?</td>', '*lol* Then you haven''t seen the horrible sculpture that they put outside our train station! It''s a puke brown statement to homoerotic writers with dislocated joints and little corn and human figures dancing on it... It ain''t pretty.  But besides that, I like the repeated curves of the building in the photo - it makes the entire image spin. It''s difficult to decide which colour that''s most dominant though - the blue or red?', '2008-07-10 19:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4817889, 694916, 95697, '<td valign="top">*censored* brilliant!</td>', '*censored* brilliant!', '2008-07-10 19:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4817891, 695839, 95697, '<td valign="top">Aww, beautiful...</td>', 'Aww, beautiful...', '2008-07-10 19:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4817897, 695323, 95697, '<td valign="top">Interesting... It took me a second to even figure out what it is - love it!</td>', 'Interesting... It took me a second to even figure out what it is - love it!', '2008-07-10 20:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4817928, 695852, 72068, '<td valign="top">Glasto?</td>', 'Glasto?', '2008-07-10 20:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818010, 696165, 51747, '<td valign="top">I would have voted higher if it were just a little brighter</td>', 'I would have voted higher if it were just a little brighter', '2008-07-10 21:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818018, 695950, 51747, '<td valign="top">A nice image. Perhaps a little too contrasty ( is that a word????  lol).</td>', 'A nice image. Perhaps a little too contrasty ( is that a word????  lol).', '2008-07-10 21:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818021, 695896, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice picture and a cool heron.</td>', 'Nice picture and a cool heron.', '2008-07-10 21:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818034, 696025, 51747, '<td valign="top">Hmmm I am trying to think about how this meets the challenge?? Ok, point of color, check. Rule of thirds, check. Ok 2 points for each.</td>', 'Hmmm I am trying to think about how this meets the challenge?? Ok, point of color, check. Rule of thirds, check. Ok 2 points for each.', '2008-07-10 21:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818035, 696074, 83313, '<td valign="top">Certainly meets the challenge. I find though, that the comp seems to lead my eye past the subject. It floats between the two trees and does not ever really want to settle on the bench.</td>', 'Certainly meets the challenge. I find though, that the comp seems to lead my eye past the subject. It floats between the two trees and does not ever really want to settle on the bench.', '2008-07-10 21:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818039, 696098, 83313, '<td valign="top">Simple and pleasing shapes and colors.</td>', 'Simple and pleasing shapes and colors.', '2008-07-10 21:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818046, 695959, 51747, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.</td>', 'Very nice image.', '2008-07-10 21:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818065, 694617, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice processing. The red really pops!</td>', 'Nice processing. The red really pops!', '2008-07-10 21:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818070, 695616, 83313, '<td valign="top">A bit too high key for my preference, but I think that was the look you were going for.</td>', 'A bit too high key for my preference, but I think that was the look you were going for.', '2008-07-10 21:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818074, 695754, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems more of an entire background of color. I can see however, that you wanted the yellow to stand out. I do like it, though. Nice application of a narrow DOF.</td>', 'Seems more of an entire background of color. I can see however, that you wanted the yellow to stand out. I do like it, though. Nice application of a narrow DOF.', '2008-07-10 21:56:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4818076, 695839, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice water bead. Lighting is great. I need to spend some time learning how to do this kind of lighting work.</td>', 'Nice water bead. Lighting is great. I need to spend some time learning how to do this kind of lighting work.', '2008-07-10 21:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818077, 695484, 51747, '<td valign="top">That''s too funny!</td>', 'That''s too funny!', '2008-07-10 21:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818079, 695940, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cool looking bug shot.</td>', 'Cool looking bug shot.', '2008-07-10 21:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818083, 695671, 95978, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice shot!', '2008-07-10 22:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818084, 696155, 83313, '<td valign="top">Love the mist and the soft lighting it creates here. the barely visible rocks under the water work nicely too. Composition doesn''t quite lead my eye, but otherwise I really like this.</td>', 'Love the mist and the soft lighting it creates here. the barely visible rocks under the water work nicely too. Composition doesn''t quite lead my eye, but otherwise I really like this.', '2008-07-10 22:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818085, 695359, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice. I have to get a better vantage point for next years fireworks. They have so much more "wow" when there is something else in the picture.</td>', 'Nice. I have to get a better vantage point for next years fireworks. They have so much more "wow" when there is something else in the picture.', '2008-07-10 22:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818087, 696077, 83313, '<td valign="top">I suspect this may not do well because of the abstractness, but I won''t be one to low vote it for that! Reminds me a little of some 70''s pop-art.</td>', 'I suspect this may not do well because of the abstractness, but I won''t be one to low vote it for that! Reminds me a little of some 70''s pop-art.', '2008-07-10 22:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818089, 695533, 83313, '<td valign="top">This one really caught me by surprise! Not my own style, but it''s very good.</td>', 'This one really caught me by surprise! Not my own style, but it''s very good.', '2008-07-10 22:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818101, 695910, 29011, '<td valign="top">This is quite beautiful. Love the color. As the challeng theme goes, the green is standing out as the point of color, not the reds. Challenge theme aside this works really well for me. The colors looks great, the flowers not overly saturated. Nice detail too.</td>', 'This is quite beautiful. Love the color. As the challeng theme goes, the green is standing out as the point of color, not the reds. Challenge theme aside this works really well for me. The colors looks great, the flowers not overly saturated. Nice detail too.', '2008-07-10 22:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818145, 696145, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m finding the plug gets a little lost int he background. Nice popping colors, though.</td>', 'I''m finding the plug gets a little lost int he background. Nice popping colors, though.', '2008-07-10 23:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818146, 695859, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ahead, warp factor 6!</td>', 'Ahead, warp factor 6!', '2008-07-10 23:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818148, 696163, 83313, '<td valign="top">A pleasing woods scene, and I like it, though I don'' think any color really stands out from the rest of the scene.</td>', 'A pleasing woods scene, and I like it, though I don'' think any color really stands out from the rest of the scene.', '2008-07-10 23:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818150, 694940, 83313, '<td valign="top">The foreground may be a little too saturated for the turtle to really stand out like he needs to.</td>', 'The foreground may be a little too saturated for the turtle to really stand out like he needs to.', '2008-07-10 23:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818151, 694983, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice eye for catching this interesting view of a common item. I love stuff like this!</td>', 'Nice eye for catching this interesting view of a common item. I love stuff like this!', '2008-07-10 23:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818152, 696044, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wiggle, wiggle, Happy feet!! (Ok, that wasn''t a terribly useful comment, but it was my reaction to this one!)</td>', 'Wiggle, wiggle, Happy feet!! (Ok, that wasn''t a terribly useful comment, but it was my reaction to this one!)', '2008-07-10 23:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818153, 695414, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice backlighting and use of negative space here.</td>', 'Nice backlighting and use of negative space here.', '2008-07-10 23:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818157, 696085, 83313, '<td valign="top">A really interesting perspective, especially with the point of color spread across the very bottom the frame like this. It''s different, but it works.</td>', 'A really interesting perspective, especially with the point of color spread across the very bottom the frame like this. It''s different, but it works.', '2008-07-10 23:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4818161, 693850, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m finding this a bit oversaturated on the orange, but it should do well in voting. I like the reflections visible in the muddy water.</td>', 'I''m finding this a bit oversaturated on the orange, but it should do well in voting. I like the reflections visible in the muddy water.', '2008-07-10 23:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
