(4818164, 695636, 83313, '<td valign="top">It looks a little odd, the flower is tack sharp and the stem and bottle at the same distance are a touch soft compared to it. Nice and bold, though. Lots of visual impact.</td>', 'It looks a little odd, the flower is tack sharp and the stem and bottle at the same distance are a touch soft compared to it. Nice and bold, though. Lots of visual impact.', '2008-07-10 23:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
