(4818998, 695852, 63269, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture, the focus is crystal clear and the colors and exposure are great. My only problem is that the composition is a bit weak. Otherwise not bad! :)</td>', 'Excellent capture, the focus is crystal clear and the colors and exposure are great. My only problem is that the composition is a bit weak. Otherwise not bad! :)', '2008-07-11 11:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
