(4819008, 694918, 63269, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. I personally might not have cropped so much of the subject''s head off, but that''s just me. also, the light is a little harsh, one can see sharp shadows created by the flash. Otherwise I think this is pretty good. :)</td>', 'Hmmm. I personally might not have cropped so much of the subject''s head off, but that''s just me. also, the light is a little harsh, one can see sharp shadows created by the flash. Otherwise I think this is pretty good. :)', '2008-07-11 11:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4819013, 695170, 63269, '<td valign="top">Allright, this really looks kind of cool, but I think the grain is a serious issue. I do love the exquisite shade of blue though, and the mysterious shapes and shadows, and it meets the challenge quite well IMO.</td>', 'Allright, this really looks kind of cool, but I think the grain is a serious issue. I do love the exquisite shade of blue though, and the mysterious shapes and shadows, and it meets the challenge quite well IMO.', '2008-07-11 11:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4819014, 694991, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very excellent capture.</td>', 'Very excellent capture.', '2008-07-11 11:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4819022, 696164, 63269, '<td valign="top">To my eyes and my screen, this is showing up a little grain and possibly almost out of focus, as though the turkey moved. This is, however, and excellent concept, and if it weren''t for the grain and the focus, I think it would be an excellent image! :)</td>', 'To my eyes and my screen, this is showing up a little grain and possibly almost out of focus, as though the turkey moved. This is, however, and excellent concept, and if it weren''t for the grain and the focus, I think it would be an excellent image! :)', '2008-07-11 11:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4819028, 695891, 63269, '<td valign="top">The perfection of the straight clean lines makes for an interesting study in geometry. I do think the composition is a little cluttered however; my eyes don''t know where to rest.</td>', 'The perfection of the straight clean lines makes for an interesting study in geometry. I do think the composition is a little cluttered however; my eyes don''t know where to rest.', '2008-07-11 11:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4819029, 695839, 63269, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2008-07-11 11:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4819035, 696159, 63269, '<td valign="top">Way too neat! I just wish the very tip of the plant were in perfect focus; it looks like something moved just a bit. Otherwise I like this a lot</td>', 'Way too neat! I just wish the very tip of the plant were in perfect focus; it looks like something moved just a bit. Otherwise I like this a lot', '2008-07-11 11:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4819050, 695957, 63269, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit over saturated... on my screen, I can see lots of grain caused by too much saturation. I would imagine your intent was to brighten up the firework, but IMHO having the color in the firework isn''t worth the over-saturation in the rest of the image. However, I really like the composition and the angle you chose to shoot this photo from. It makes the photo much more interesting! :)</td>', 'This looks a bit over saturated... on my screen, I can see lots of grain caused by too much saturation. I would imagine your intent was to brighten up the firework, but IMHO having the color in the firework isn''t worth the over-saturation in the rest of the image. However, I really like the composition and the angle you chose to shoot this photo from. It makes the photo much more interesting! :)', '2008-07-11 11:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4819056, 695687, 63269, '<td valign="top">IMO the centered composition doesn''t work very well here, but otherwise, this is a fine image.</td>', 'IMO the centered composition doesn''t work very well here, but otherwise, this is a fine image.', '2008-07-11 11:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4819065, 695465, 63269, '<td valign="top">I think this has lots of potential. These are such beautiful flowers and the colors and focus you have here are excellent. However, I think the composition isn''t as good as it could be. I wonder how this might look if the flowers were off to one side, edge, or corner of the photo? Just a thought. :)</td>', 'I think this has lots of potential. These are such beautiful flowers and the colors and focus you have here are excellent. However, I think the composition isn''t as good as it could be. I wonder how this might look if the flowers were off to one side, edge, or corner of the photo? Just a thought. :)', '2008-07-11 11:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4819066, 695942, 63269, '<td valign="top">Very creative choice of angle - well done!</td>', 'Very creative choice of angle - well done!', '2008-07-11 11:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4819074, 695616, 63269, '<td valign="top">I was delighted when this came up on the screen! I absolutely love the crisp contrast and the different tones. Beautiful.</td>', 'I was delighted when this came up on the screen! I absolutely love the crisp contrast and the different tones. Beautiful.', '2008-07-11 11:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4819076, 693884, 63269, '<td valign="top">This looks a little hazy, I wonder if more contrast might have cleared that up? Also, it would have been really nice to clear up the light poles, but I have no idea if that was even possible. Perhaps this was the only angle at which you could see the rainbow, or you simply couldn''t get to a different spot. This certainly is a beautiful scene though! :)</td>', 'This looks a little hazy, I wonder if more contrast might have cleared that up? Also, it would have been really nice to clear up the light poles, but I have no idea if that was even possible. Perhaps this was the only angle at which you could see the rainbow, or you simply couldn''t get to a different spot. This certainly is a beautiful scene though! :)', '2008-07-11 11:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4819077, 695242, 63269, '<td valign="top">The bright contrast of the vivid orange against the dull greens and grays is perfect. a different composition might have worked better, however, and made the photo a bit more visually interesting.</td>', 'The bright contrast of the vivid orange against the dull greens and grays is perfect. a different composition might have worked better, however, and made the photo a bit more visually interesting.', '2008-07-11 11:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4819085, 694786, 63269, '<td valign="top">This looks just <i>slightly</i> out of focus, and also, the composition is a little weak. Perhaps if you moved the leaf off to one side or corner of the photo, the photo would have more visual impact.</td>', 'This looks just slightly out of focus, and also, the composition is a little weak. Perhaps if you moved the leaf off to one side or corner of the photo, the photo would have more visual impact.', '2008-07-11 11:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4819093, 695880, 63269, '<td valign="top">I wonder how this might possibly look with more contrast.... the waters have a rather dull gray color. I realize though, that when shooting water/lake scenes, getting the colors right can be very difficult. Perhaps there was no way to fix the gray water. Otherwise this is a nice photo. :)</td>', 'I wonder how this might possibly look with more contrast.... the waters have a rather dull gray color. I realize though, that when shooting water/lake scenes, getting the colors right can be very difficult. Perhaps there was no way to fix the gray water. Otherwise this is a nice photo. :)', '2008-07-11 11:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4819094, 694257, 63269, '<td valign="top">I like the bright contrasts and colors.</td>', 'I like the bright contrasts and colors.', '2008-07-11 11:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
