(4819971, 695849, 54645, '<td valign="top">Looks yellow to me ;) I''m sure others have said that. I like the compostion and the checkered pattern. The pepper does not appear real, it''s as if it was place in the image.</td>', 'Looks yellow to me ;) I''m sure others have said that. I like the compostion and the checkered pattern. The pepper does not appear real, it''s as if it was place in the image.', '2008-07-11 22:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
