(4820698, 696111, 3936, '<td valign="top">Nice humorous take on the challenge.  Depth of field could be a little shorter to make background even softer.  Litteralists will not see any mist.  Cute photo and made me chuckle.  7</td>', 'Nice humorous take on the challenge.  Depth of field could be a little shorter to make background even softer.  Litteralists will not see any mist.  Cute photo and made me chuckle.  7', '2008-07-12 11:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820703, 695628, 3936, '<td valign="top">I think you are going to get a few "does not meet challenge", comments, because there does seem to be a lot of green.  However, this is an excellent photo.  The eyes are amazing and the two greens are different enough to work for me.  Skin tones are great, the eyes are amazing.  Depth of field was well used to eliminate distractions.  Focus is great, I love all the super detail.  I could see this in a magazine, a travel ad,or a gallery.  This is one of those that you can look at day after day and not get tired of seeing it.  You have a 10 from me.</td>', 'I think you are going to get a few "does not meet challenge", comments, because there does seem to be a lot of green.  However, this is an excellent photo.  The eyes are amazing and the two greens are different enough to work for me.  Skin tones are great, the eyes are amazing.  Depth of field was well used to eliminate distractions.  Focus is great, I love all the super detail.  I could see this in a magazine, a travel ad,or a gallery.  This is one of those that you can look at day after day and not get tired of seeing it.  You have a 10 from me.', '2008-07-12 11:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820704, 695601, 3936, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if I would call this a "point of color", though it does communicate "the point of color".  I like the pose, like the color, like the lighting.  8</td>', 'I don''t know if I would call this a "point of color", though it does communicate "the point of color".  I like the pose, like the color, like the lighting.  8', '2008-07-12 11:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820735, 694700, 76335, '<td valign="top">Color''s good and strong, but the photo lacks cripsness and could be sharper. Also the lighting''s a little flat and the top of her head is in the shadows. Good idea though -- I like the pose and framing.</td>', 'Color''s good and strong, but the photo lacks cripsness and could be sharper. Also the lighting''s a little flat and the top of her head is in the shadows. Good idea though -- I like the pose and framing.', '2008-07-12 11:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820737, 695922, 76335, '<td valign="top">Great idea and well composed.</td>', 'Great idea and well composed.', '2008-07-12 11:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820740, 693964, 76335, '<td valign="top">A little dark in the background. The color''s strong and probably doesn''t need much help stanidng out.</td>', 'A little dark in the background. The color''s strong and probably doesn''t need much help stanidng out.', '2008-07-12 12:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820743, 695648, 76335, '<td valign="top">Believable? Not really -- looks like he was put up to it. Still a good fun shot with great color.</td>', 'Believable? Not really -- looks like he was put up to it. Still a good fun shot with great color.', '2008-07-12 12:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820748, 695852, 76335, '<td valign="top">What a great candid and an original idea for this challenge.</td>', 'What a great candid and an original idea for this challenge.', '2008-07-12 12:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820935, 696147, 58457, '<td valign="top">this has a really nice timelessness to it.  it may not fit the theme as well as some others in the challenge (i''m not half way through voting yet), but i enjoy it as a nice photo.</td>', 'this has a really nice timelessness to it.  it may not fit the theme as well as some others in the challenge (i''m not half way through voting yet), but i enjoy it as a nice photo.', '2008-07-12 14:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820966, 695671, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the point of color is supposed to be. Both the sun and the flowers are candidates -- competing for the viewer''s attention for that matter. The lighting here is stunning and beuatiful.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the point of color is supposed to be. Both the sun and the flowers are candidates -- competing for the viewer''s attention for that matter. The lighting here is stunning and beuatiful.', '2008-07-12 15:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820972, 696124, 76335, '<td valign="top">Needs some contrast; it''s kind of dull. It''s a nice scene though.</td>', 'Needs some contrast; it''s kind of dull. It''s a nice scene though.', '2008-07-12 15:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820980, 696154, 58457, '<td valign="top">the inclusion of the city skyline makes this a better than average fireworks shot, but I think I may have cropped the upper half of this and gone with more of a panoramic.</td>', 'the inclusion of the city skyline makes this a better than average fireworks shot, but I think I may have cropped the upper half of this and gone with more of a panoramic.', '2008-07-12 15:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820981, 696145, 58457, '<td valign="top">for some reason this appears like it should be a boring picture.  however, there is something about it that i like--the vibrant colors help a lot, plus the symmetry between the hydrant and the fountain add to the composition.</td>', 'for some reason this appears like it should be a boring picture.  however, there is something about it that i like--the vibrant colors help a lot, plus the symmetry between the hydrant and the fountain add to the composition.', '2008-07-12 15:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820985, 696037, 90495, '<td valign="top">hmm not enough colour for it to be ''a point of colour'' in my book.</td>', 'hmm not enough colour for it to be ''a point of colour'' in my book.', '2008-07-12 15:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820987, 695776, 90495, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured and the exposure is perfect.</td>', 'Nicely captured and the exposure is perfect.', '2008-07-12 15:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820989, 695522, 58457, '<td valign="top">the composition of this somewhat mundane scene makes for a very solid image.  the division of the flag in the window pane helps quite a bit.  nice work--well seen.</td>', 'the composition of this somewhat mundane scene makes for a very solid image.  the division of the flag in the window pane helps quite a bit.  nice work--well seen.', '2008-07-12 15:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820992, 695895, 58457, '<td valign="top">i like this photo and its solidly composed (i would like to see the tip of his nose in focus).  but for this challenge I think there are photos that do fit the theme better.</td>', 'i like this photo and its solidly composed (i would like to see the tip of his nose in focus).  but for this challenge I think there are photos that do fit the theme better.', '2008-07-12 15:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820993, 695225, 90495, '<td valign="top">With a straighter composition this would have gotten an 8 from me.</td>', 'With a straighter composition this would have gotten an 8 from me.', '2008-07-12 15:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4820994, 695747, 58457, '<td valign="top">interesting abstract.  I''m not sure I like the white lines on the right side of the red squares--it looks like an overshapening artifact...  otherwise, it does have visual interest to me.</td>', 'interesting abstract.  I''m not sure I like the white lines on the right side of the red squares--it looks like an overshapening artifact...  otherwise, it does have visual interest to me.', '2008-07-12 15:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4821000, 695702, 90495, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.</td>', 'Lovely shot.', '2008-07-12 15:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4821001, 695745, 58457, '<td valign="top">for this challenge I''m not sure how well it does, but on its own I like that the sculpture mirrors the architecture in the backgroun.</td>', 'for this challenge I''m not sure how well it does, but on its own I like that the sculpture mirrors the architecture in the backgroun.', '2008-07-12 15:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4821002, 695564, 90495, '<td valign="top">Bad makeup day. I see a whole lot of dots on her skin. Love the comp.</td>', 'Bad makeup day. I see a whole lot of dots on her skin. Love the comp.', '2008-07-12 15:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4821004, 694854, 90495, '<td valign="top">Too much colour, don''t know where that point of colour is. But that may be a too literal definition of the challenge.</td>', 'Too much colour, don''t know where that point of colour is. But that may be a too literal definition of the challenge.', '2008-07-12 15:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4821020, 695849, 58457, '<td valign="top">is that background real??</td>', 'is that background real??', '2008-07-12 16:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4821026, 693541, 58457, '<td valign="top">cute still life, but that checked pattern is a little hard to look at.</td>', 'cute still life, but that checked pattern is a little hard to look at.', '2008-07-12 16:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
