(4822372, 695270, 70000, '<td valign="top">VERY cool! This goes beyond the classic elegant portrait of a bird and creates a really interesting dynamic between the three birds. The refections and bright blue color of the water create an great environment! Beautiful</td>', 'VERY cool! This goes beyond the classic elegant portrait of a bird and creates a really interesting dynamic between the three birds. The refections and bright blue color of the water create an great environment! Beautiful', '2008-07-13 18:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
