(4822429, 695757, 41211, '<td valign="top">What a fun picture. I love the color of blue in the balloons. Adds to the ''fresh'' feeling of this photo.</td>', 'What a fun picture. I love the color of blue in the balloons. Adds to the ''fresh'' feeling of this photo.', '2008-07-13 19:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
