(4823447, 695754, 68035, '<td valign="top">This was great macro, but - to my shame - I think I failed to get it.  You are 100% right when you mention that no one said that the point of colour had to be light.  I looked at this shot and thought ''beautiful but the colour - ie in my eyes that flower rather than the stamen - was not a point of colour.<br/> <br/>I need to open my mind as well as my eyes a little.<br/> <br/>I scored this a 5 but having read your description I can see this was a greivous underscore<br/> <br/>Sorry Michelle, definitely a case of the voter being wrong and not the photo</td>', 'This was great macro, but - to my shame - I think I failed to get it.  You are 100% right when you mention that no one said that the point of colour had to be light.  I looked at this shot and thought ''beautiful but the colour - ie in my eyes that flower rather than the stamen - was not a point of colour. I need to open my mind as well as my eyes a little. I scored this a 5 but having read your description I can see this was a greivous underscore Sorry Michelle, definitely a case of the voter being wrong and not the photo', '2008-07-14 06:11:44.000000', NULL, 0),
