(4823456, 696098, 68035, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and nice finish Ron.  The blue and yellow of course work very well together and the drawn line has a beauth all of its own.  I am intrigued as to how you suspended the pencil.  I guess the slight shadow is the sort of thing that may have cost this an even higher finish.  I am not sure whether this could have been cloned out or not (after reading recent threads on what is allowable my guess would be yes)<br/> <br/>Very sharp and crisp<br/> <br/>Good job buddy</td>', 'Nice shot and nice finish Ron.  The blue and yellow of course work very well together and the drawn line has a beauth all of its own.  I am intrigued as to how you suspended the pencil.  I guess the slight shadow is the sort of thing that may have cost this an even higher finish.  I am not sure whether this could have been cloned out or not (after reading recent threads on what is allowable my guess would be yes) Very sharp and crisp Good job buddy', '2008-07-14 06:22:07.000000', NULL, 0),
