(4834171, 695481, 15291, '<td valign="top">Hi Stan,<br/> <br/>       Nice image, It is a simple image that gets your point accross effectively. The colors are rich, deep and well balanced. The composition is well done. I like the use of the "X" pattern here it helps keep the eyes attention on the water bottle. The image is clean,sharp and the texture in the sand is well done.</td>', 'Hi Stan,        Nice image, It is a simple image that gets your point accross effectively. The colors are rich, deep and well balanced. The composition is well done. I like the use of the "X" pattern here it helps keep the eyes attention on the water bottle. The image is clean,sharp and the texture in the sand is well done.', '2008-07-19 18:36:33.000000', NULL, 0),
