(4844876, 695225, 54563, '<td valign="top">thank you all and thank you tom too for the posthumous award!<br/> <br/>i don''t do a lot of setting up for shots I just kinda go with the flow.  the colours caught me and it was a little bench my son had put his treat on<br/> <br/>I don''t understand the obsession with making everything totally un crooked :) life is crooked and I don''t think the shot would be any better straightened... just straighter and anyone can do that<br/> <br/>I am really glad I had something that week that fit at least one (though might have worked for two) challenges :)</td>', 'thank you all and thank you tom too for the posthumous award! i don''t do a lot of setting up for shots I just kinda go with the flow.  the colours caught me and it was a little bench my son had put his treat on I don''t understand the obsession with making everything totally un crooked :) life is crooked and I don''t think the shot would be any better straightened... just straighter and anyone can do that I am really glad I had something that week that fit at least one (though might have worked for two) challenges :)', '2008-07-25 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 0),
